data: {"trustLevel":"AGENT_EXPLORATORY","blocks":[{"type":"text","markdown":"已提交最终答复。核心情况说明：\n\n**本轮无法给出业务数字——取证环节失败。** 我在第一轮并行发起了知识检索与只有探索性的目录探查，但 `discover(solvers)`、`discover(object_types)`、`search_experience` 均因预算耗尽返回错误，只有一次 `retrieve_knowledge` 成功（且只返回了求解器与规则的口径说明，不含任何订单/物料/财务数字）。\n\n因此答复按「诚实边界」处理：\n\n1. **不给任何编造数字**，电解液涨价 15% 仅作为用户给定前提，明确标为未验证假设，不标溯源；\n2. **给出可用的方法与口径**：这一问必须走 `finance_world_projection`（吃 worldId、用落在 Order 上的 costPressure 做投影），`finance_pnl` 对任何扰动都返回同一组数、答不了这一问；判定受 C15 经营毛利底线与 C24 接单毛利过线约束；\n3. **给出补救路径**：`sim_init` 开沙盘施加涨价扰动 → `finance_world_projection` 取成本/毛利 Δ → 沿 BOM 通路定位受影响订单 → 逐单 `quote_margin` 核对是否跌破地板线；若需调价/换料，走 `create_action_draft` 出草稿待审批；\n4. **明示缺口**：需求清单是「电解液在 BOM 中的单台用量 + 订单毛利基线」，缺这两项任何数字都不可信。\n\n（此前一次误用了 `mcp__builtin__final_answer` 工具名被拒，已改用 `final_answer` 正常收尾。）"},{"type":"text","markdown":"【本次运行中有工具调用未成功】以下结论未包含这些调用的结果，请勿把它们当作已核实的数据：\n- mcp__builtin__discover（BUDGET_EXCEEDED）：Error: 预算已尽，请基于已有结果调用 final_answer 收尾\n- mcp__builtin__discover（BUDGET_EXCEEDED）：Error: 预算已尽，请基于已有结果调用 final_answer 收尾\n- mcp__builtin__search_experience（BUDGET_EXCEEDED）：Error: 预算已尽，请基于已有结果调用 final_answer 收尾\n- mcp__builtin__final_answer（ERROR）：Error: tool mcp__builtin__final_answer not in agent scope allow-list (scopeDeclaration ∪ granted)"}],"provenance":[{"id":"prov_01M4JR2A5751ASJ4C1P508RVHK","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JR1QVAD7NANR87W077H43X","toolName":"mcp__builtin__retrieve_knowledge","outputPath":"results[6]"},{"id":"prov_01M4JR2A5769Q3M1BEN4M0C2G0","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JR1QVAD7NANR87W077H43X","toolName":"mcp__builtin__retrieve_knowledge","outputPath":"results[2]"},{"id":"prov_01M4JR2A57Z3CQCDGRA57FQG5D","source":"TOOL_RESULT","toolCallId":"tc_01M4JR1QVAD7NANR87W077H43X","toolName":"mcp__builtin__retrieve_knowledge","outputPath":"results[7]"}],"unverifiedNumerics":true,"stats":{"sessionStats":{"turns":1,"steps":4,"llmMs":22758,"toolMs":3484,"ttftMs":4632,"ttftSteps":4,"decodeMs":18126,"decodeTokens":4743},"tokenUsage":{"uncachedInputTokens":6833,"outputTokens":4743,"cacheReadTokens":142720,"cacheWriteTokens":0},"contextPressure":{"pressureTokens":40176}}}

